      {
        "id": "u5",
        "kind": "EXAMPLE",
        "label": "Interpreting stoichiometric coefficients in water formation",
        "attributes": {
          "context": "real_world",
          "treatment": "illustrative"
        },
        "subtopic_ids": [
          "s5"
        ],
        "rationale": "Illustrates how coefficients in the reaction 2H2 + O2 -> 2H2O map onto molecules, moles, and masses.",
        "review_flags": [],
        "contextualization": {
          "value": "none",
          "evidence": []
        },
        "passages": [
          {
            "id": "p21",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "**उदाहरण देखते हैं:** पानी बनने की अभिक्रिया",
            "start": 1417,
            "end": 1461
          },
          {
            "id": "p22",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "$$2H_2 + O_2 \\rightarrow 2H_2O$$",
            "start": 1462,
            "end": 1494
          },
          {
            "id": "p23",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "यहाँ जो आगे नंबर लिखे हैं ($H_2$ के आगे **2**, $O_2$ के आगे **1** (छुपा हुआ), और $H_2O$ के आगे **2**), इन्हें **Stoichiometric Coefficients** कहते हैं।",
            "start": 1496,
            "end": 1647
          },
          {
            "id": "p24",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "इसका मतलब क्या है?",
            "start": 1649,
            "end": 1667
          },
          {
            "id": "p25",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "1. **अणुओं (Molecules) के रूप में:**",
            "start": 1668,
            "end": 1704
          },
          {
            "id": "p26",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   * हाइड्रोजन के 2 अणु + ऑक्सीजन का 1 अणु = पानी के 2 अणु",
            "start": 1705,
            "end": 1763
          },
          {
            "id": "p27",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "2. **मोल (Moles) के रूप में (सबसे महत्वपूर्ण):**",
            "start": 1764,
            "end": 1812
          },
          {
            "id": "p28",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   * **2 मोल $H_2$ + 1 मोल $O_2$ $\\rightarrow$ 2 मोल $H_2O$**",
            "start": 1813,
            "end": 1874
          },
          {
            "id": "p29",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "3. **द्रव्यमान (Mass) के रूप में:**",
            "start": 1875,
            "end": 1910
          },
          {
            "id": "p30",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation",
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   * $2 \\times 2\\text{ g } (H_2) + 32\\text{ g } (O_2) = 2 \\times 18\\text{ g } (H_2O)$",
            "start": 1911,
            "end": 1996
          },
          {
            "id": "p31",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation",
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   * यानी **$4\\text{ g } H_2 + 32\\text{ g } O_2 = 36\\text{ g } H_2O$** (दोनों तरफ कुल 36 ग्राम है!)",
            "start": 1997,
            "end": 2096
          }
        ],
        "accuracy": {
          "verdict": "accurate",
          "reason": "All calculations and interpretations across molecular, molar, and mass levels are completely accurate.",
          "errors": []
        }
